        nav_guestbook: 'Guestbook', guestbook_title: '✦ Guestbook ✦', guestbook_name: 'Your name', guestbook_message: 'Leave a message...', guestbook_send: 'Send', guestbook_success: 'Thanks for your message ✦',
        osu_page_title: '✦ osu! Song Collection + Total PP Lookup ✦', visitor_lookup_title: '✦ Look Up Your osu! PP ✦', visitor_lookup_placeholder: 'Enter osu! username or ID', visitor_lookup_btn: 'Search',
        nav_guide: 'Guide', guide_title: '✦ User Guide ✦', guide_prev: '◀ Previous', guide_next: 'Next ▶',
        guide_lang_title: 'Switch Language', guide_lang_desc: '8 language buttons (中/EN/日/한/РУ/FR/ES/DE) at the top of the page — click to instantly switch the entire site\'s display language. Your choice is saved automatically so you won\'t need to pick again next visit.',
        guide_quiz_title: 'Vocabulary Quiz',         guide_quiz_desc: 'Vocabulary quizzes in 5 languages — all word banks are loaded live from Google Sheets. 🇯🇵🇰🇷 Japanese/Korean: choose "meaning mode", "reading mode", or mixed; answers can be Chinese or English. 🇫🇷 French: meaning mode with Chinese or English answers. 🇺🇸 English: English-to-Chinese. 🇨🇳 Chinese (for foreign friends): pick Traditional or Simplified display first — Traditional can test Bopomofo or English meaning, Simplified can test Pinyin or English meaning. Choose 10/20/30 questions or unlimited. Scoring: +10 per correct answer, -3 per wrong answer. Each question is read aloud (🔊 at top-right toggles auto-reading; 🔊 next to the question replays it). At the end, a result card shows your correct/wrong count, score, accuracy, and a full review of every question. Hit "📱 Share Score" to copy or download a beautiful score card to share with friends! If you go offline, it automatically falls back to the last successfully loaded word list, if one is available.',
        guide_mistake_title: 'Mistake Notebook', guide_mistake_desc: 'Every wrong answer is automatically saved! On the language selection page, tap the 📖 Mistake Notebook button (the pink badge shows your total mistake count). Mistakes are grouped by language — each entry shows the correct answer and how many times you got it wrong (×2 = 2 mistakes). Once a language has 4 or more mistakes, you can start a Review Quiz — correct answers are removed from the notebook (you learned it!), wrong ones stay and keep counting. You can also tap ✕ to delete a single entry or 🗑 to clear an entire language. Data is stored locally in your browser (localStorage).',
        guide_stats_title: 'Quiz Statistics', guide_stats_desc: 'Every completed quiz is automatically recorded! Tap 📊 Quiz Statistics to see: four summary tiles at the top (total quizzes, average accuracy, best score, total questions answered); a line chart in the middle showing your accuracy trend over the last 20 quizzes so you can track your progress; and a table at the bottom listing your 10 most recent results (date, language, score, accuracy). Entries marked 📖 are review sessions from the Mistake Notebook. Green rows mean 60%+ accuracy.',
        guide_music_title: 'Music Collection', guide_music_desc: 'Embedded Spotify player featuring my favorite songs. Switch between "♫ All Songs" and "♫ Chinese / Cantonese" playlists. Log in to Spotify to play full tracks right on the page; without logging in you can still preview 30-second clips.',
        guide_osu_title: 'osu! Collection', guide_osu_desc: 'My beatmap collection! Enter a Beatmap ID or paste an osu! URL to add a map — the site auto-fetches cover art, title, artist, BPM, and all difficulty names, then sorts it into the correct mode tab: ⭕ Standard / 🥁 Taiko / 🍎 Catch / 🎹 Mania. Each card has: ♡ favorite (pinned to top), 🎧 30-second audio preview, 📋 copy ID, and clicking the card opens the map on osu!. A search bar at the top lets you filter by song name or artist. Use 📤 Export / 📥 Import in the top-right to back up your collection as a JSON file.',
        guide_about_title: 'About Me + PP Lookup', guide_about_desc: 'My personal introduction, hobbies, and social links. The osu! Profile Card at the bottom auto-loads my live stats — tap the ⭕🥁🍎🎹 tabs to view PP, world rank, accuracy, play count, and more for each mode, plus a combined total PP. Below that, the PP Lookup tool is open to everyone: enter your own osu! username or ID to see your PP across all 4 modes and your total — come compare!',
        guide_guestbook_title: 'Guestbook', guide_guestbook_desc: 'Leave your mark! Enter a nickname and message, then hit send. Messages are stored in the cloud (Google Sheet) and visible to all visitors — help make this place lively!',
        guide_season_title: 'Seasonal Effects', guide_season_desc: 'The circular button in the bottom-right corner switches seasonal background effects: Spring 🌸 sakura petals, Summer ✨ fireflies, Autumn 🍁 falling leaves, Winter ❄️ snowflakes. Your choice is saved automatically.',
        guide_bgm_title: 'BGM Vinyl Player', guide_bgm_desc: 'The vinyl record in the bottom-left is a built-in lo-fi music player! Click the disc to play/pause — the record spins while playing. Hover over it to reveal the control panel: track name, ⏮⏭ to skip between songs, and a volume slider (your volume preference is saved). 4 relaxing royalty-free lo-fi tracks play back-to-back automatically — great for studying or browsing.',
        guide_clock_title: 'Clock & Weather', guide_clock_desc: 'The small widget above the season button (bottom-right) shows the current time and date. If you allow location access, it also displays your local weather icon and temperature, auto-refreshing every 30 minutes; otherwise it falls back to a default city.',
        guide_fx_title: 'Interactive Effects', guide_fx_desc: 'Click anywhere on the page to burst 🌸✨💮⭐ particles from your cursor! There\'s also an elegant entrance animation on first visit.',
        guestbook_loading: 'Loading...', guestbook_empty: 'No messages yet. Be the first!',
